            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonu nasıl adlandırırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">camel case kullanarak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyonun adına boşluklar ekleyerek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">camel case kullanarak.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sabah rutinini başlatan fonksiyon için hangi ad camel case biçimine uyar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>morningRoutine</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>morning routine</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Morning_Routine</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>morningRoutine</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
